{"id":18856160616,"name":" Undead Defense","desc":"Undead Defense is a teamwork based zombie survival game where players are divided into two teams: humans and zombies.\nThe goal is simple: humans must survive until the end of the 6 waves, while zombies try to infect all the humans.\n\nAs a Human: 👤\nFind a safe spot, build barricades, cooperate, fight off zombies, and upgrade\n\nAs a Zombie: 🧟\nAttack humans, coordinate with other zombies, and don’t give up: Even if you die, you’ll respawn and keep attacking until all humans are infected or until the wave has ended.\n\n[PC Controls] 💻\nE - Grab prop\nRMB (Right mouse button) - Use zombie ability / Nail prop\nQ - Zombie type selection menu / Rotate prop\nT - Tilt prop\nB - Shop\nO - Cosmetic Shop\nI - Cosmetic Inventory\nF - Flashlight\nZ - Emotes\nCTRL - Crouch\n\n[Console Controls] 🎮\nX - Grab prop / Use zombie ability / Nail prop \nUp on DPad - Flashlight\nDown on DPad - Emotes\nL2 - Tilt Prop\nR2 - Rotate prop\n\nTags: Zombie Survival, Multiplayer, Half-Life, Valve, Garry's Mod, FPS, First Person Shooter","path":"/game/18856160616-undead-defense","slug":"18856160616-undead-defense","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/68955dbc145df7af23693e86f37368e4a221d39fc08718d7f0c73531b17f693d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-92580b268c848d69ec7a0a2921fad893/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":81,"visitor":20458950,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-22T01:41:59.944Z","creator":{"name":"the crumble fan group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6947df5e53ead0ca9ac03586","title":"Berg Hub","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7892e","gameId":18856160616,"name":" Undead Defense","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bf9228cb900d411f65c2889d9ddd490fab2bedeb8354c0db94b501b9b01cbb22.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-3c292ac444be6b9a2f1af797629a869c-01240e12c288.png"},"slu